      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2013 John Wiley & Sons A/S.",
        "AbstractText": "A 29-year-old woman with hepatitis C presented 2 years after an orthotopic liver transplant with several weeks of fevers, abdominal pain, nausea, and a painful ulcerated nodular eruption on her abdomen and lower extremities. The patient was evaluated, and her case is presented and the differential discussed."
